      "closed_at": "2022-09-30T12:06:18Z",
      "body": "On our map, the default mode for shapes is square.  On the tabs, the default mode is round.  We should be consistent:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1108513/192353515-2cbed1ba-68c8-4671-9c52-7360b9f623cd.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nSo, let's use `round` for default, and `square` for selected.  It would be good to use this `square` format for icons on the tables too, if it's not too difficult (with them going to `round` when selected - if that's not also too difficult).",
